      <h2 id="who-heading">Sedation Is For More Than Just Anxiety</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
      <p>IV sedation is commonly chosen by patients with dental anxiety — but it is also a practical option for lengthy procedures, patients with a strong gag reflex, or anyone who simply wants the procedure behind them without conscious experience of it.</p>
      <p>For full-arch implant surgeries and other involved procedures, sedation allows {{ site.doctorName }} to work efficiently while you remain in a comfortable, relaxed state throughout.</p>
